creatures:
- name: Roper
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 20  
      **Hit Points** 93 (rollable(dice=11d10 + 33,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Climb 20 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Spider Climb.*** The roper can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The roper makes two Tentacle attacks, uses Reel, and makes two Bite attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ***Tentacle.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacle]), reach 60 ft. *Hit:* The target has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 14) from one of six tentacles, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the grapple ends.

      The tentacle can be damaged, freeing a creature it has ***Grappled*** when destroyed (AC 20, HP 10, ***Immunity*** to Poison and Psychic damage). Damaging the tentacle deals no damage to the roper, and a destroyed tentacle regrows at the start of the roper's next turn.

      ***Reel.*** The roper pulls each creature ***Grappled*** by it up to 30 feet straight toward it.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Aberration, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 5
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024roper
  status: 1

